## Concatenation of Array

## Appraoch
--  Find the length n of the given array.
--  Create a new array ans of size 2 * n.
--  Loop through the original array from 0 to n - 1.
--  Put nums[i] in ans[i].
--  Put the same nums[i] in ans[i + n].
--  Return ans.

Time Complexity : O(n)
Space Complexity : O(n)

SOLUTION : 
class Solution {
    public int[] getConcatenation(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length;
        int[] ans = new int[2 * n];
        for (int i = 0; i < n ; i++) {
            ans[i] = nums[i];
            ans[i + n] = nums[i];
        }
        return ans;
    }
}
